ROOM Manager is a Japanese renovation estimate / job app in `index.html` (localStorage only, demo login `room` / `1234`).

Do not break `calc()` / `mat()` cost formulas, Watanabe Pipe as the only wholesaler, or tax-included sales converted with `/1.1` for profit.

ChatGPT account data cannot be fetched by email. Full chat history is imported only from a user-provided ChatGPT export (`conversations.json` or the export ZIP) via the AI取込 tab, converted with `chatgpt-to-claude.js`.
